 4. 🎬 1 film thing: Glenn Close gets honorary Oscar 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Glenn Close in March 1989. Photo: John Downing/Hulton Archive via Getty Images Iconic actress Glenn Close, 79, will receive an honorary Oscar at Sunday's Governors Awards, after eight lifetime nominations but no wins.

 Close tells AP: "My first reaction was I don't need a consolation prize. And my second reaction was, I don't know ... do I want to end my loss record?" 🍿 Honorary Oscars, also known as Academy Honorary Awards, aren't given for a specific film, but for a body of work and contributions to the motion picture industry.

